{"title":"2025 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_18\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 18</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Bounding)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Bounding)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5(Compl._Counting)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5(Compl. Counting)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Symmetry_+_Complementary_Counting)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Symmetry + Complementary Counting)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_OmegaLearn.org\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn.org</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math_(Intuitive)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Continuum Math (Intuitive)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MadMath_(No_Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MadMath (No Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_18\">Problem 18</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 18\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/b/31b1e1af4531148cbc079023f68c2b0102c4ee69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y, z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" /> of different positive integers less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/2/1d26d0d5cad2d4409981d648313c4f2f4a2cc2eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy &gt; z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc4f63721b45da75cf0343b99b2570334b7dd65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xz &gt; y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/b/8bb95b5e834657a679c5b5d0cd7830d883a439f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$yz &gt; x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/a/46a97bbfa98f4501d862a2317b079e3b76fe2e29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}~36 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}~84 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}~186 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}~336 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}~486$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/4169fa5a43e31f7ae355d57b2ccc523d62ab8841.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;y&lt;z \\le 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"17\" />;\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because it makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9bb06ed18773c2e1ec0fa3eb1b66f00cc792f6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e12b6767375342ed57d27678e3ea1cdb97f47e15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b762aaad3d31ac8c8168d399342418e9c9282d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />;\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b0e1404de4eca35c42876bcc83707b753e990e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> but not others; \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc0006df273cb384b6c864236b3c1bf292e898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />;\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd049e624a41c0df950b22dadf2257ee2ad9410.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />;\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf07d9f0a2413768e291d1264b59b3c835e4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />;\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c37261466c0ff756401c32f293c33e111f4712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />;\nfor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cases; \n</p><p>Similarly, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b022dc8ef6d33931fc1ae3d27df3ea0a81b52936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc0006df273cb384b6c864236b3c1bf292e898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cases; for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd049e624a41c0df950b22dadf2257ee2ad9410.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cases; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c80ea5862b45877f08d698a0c893bd2806a2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf07d9f0a2413768e291d1264b59b3c835e4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cases; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd92d02476c3434bf645bf5a3bc249eca83d3c16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c37261466c0ff756401c32f293c33e111f4712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2be940191460cd30cc15596e01d6d7c52006dad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cases;\n</p><p>Total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335700d42805167b0fe3ed09e40231085e3bce0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 11 + 10 + 6 + 3 + 1 = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"216\" height=\"15\" />. Permutate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for ordered triple, it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9cae917b5aa8546d29b8dd7c2e411df84c74f519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31 \\cdot 6=186$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~imagination\n</p><p>~mathcantcount1plus1is3 (latex stuff)\n</p><p>~bouttaswitchy (minor)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For now, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7ba68bb1320d7cef253ff363af296965de2a5f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\leq y\\leq z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>First note that no number can be 0, as it would imply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/0/02026f77ccab01417d4e4230a0ec94d76446a2a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0y&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />. Similarly, no number can be 1, as it would imply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecb5f1110633420e439e2f9347f7af13ca80b91d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1y&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />. So we only need to consider numbers between 2 and 8, inclusive.\n</p><p>We may use complementary counting:\n</p><p>Consider when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33ca27cdbf91f631b68529a817b2d1e3a2b0c876.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy\\leq z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />. This implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/8/0882ae7698083df5cb98706fd83ffb74afe2457f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy\\leq 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />. Some quick calculations gives us the products <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7fdf6a513b0d50abb3495e660aebb625f37392e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot2,2\\cdot3,2\\cdot4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" />. We may now calculate the number of times each happens (we are no longer assuming <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7ba68bb1320d7cef253ff363af296965de2a5f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\leq y\\leq z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />):\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/638ee7316e2377ea24df5d33afe4ead7a45fee2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />: This case is invalid as it asks for distinct integers.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690247843f0f0c8a6eb340268a5df173a5578a81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/4991822b825b51da4ed64783381d616ae42e0db6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2,3,(n\\geq6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />. Then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/6/c3625c867b35e0ca17c1916006bc8e1ad7c80ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot3=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> cases.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b86730b0044fc73ab4a3139ef8ef98de2e7e87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4579878c4fa5c90897079f4c3a03698994830887.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2,4,(n\\geq8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />. Then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/884d73cb15052d7fb858e9132e40513dd7c7c87f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot1=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" /> cases.</li></ul>\n<p>In total, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e6596fa087ac9406f22de2017b366e98db4f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\cdot6\\cdot5=210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" /> total cases, so our final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/2/4328aedecd1e951213ddf0d536efa3a5973ea411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$210 - (18 + 6) = \\boxed{186}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"178\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~SilverRush\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/8/898e5dbcba78ed795c9805a941e519ffaa22b57a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />, all pairs work - hence, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b0c4b179d1f26d7cb33b2263359caa261572fde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{6}{3} \\cdot 6 = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"113\" height=\"55\" /> pairs.\nNow, note that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b762aaad3d31ac8c8168d399342418e9c9282d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c320c71619dcd524877e17a292ef54037dc3c4e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />, contradiction. Therefore, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> (since we said <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7f975f29378f9252e82892597e93fb97ea88b73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 3, x \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />). Note that we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cf4013e948110f2c25ce6e9aef67339a31eecb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y&gt;z&gt;\\frac{y}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"34\" />. WLOG assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b762aaad3d31ac8c8168d399342418e9c9282d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />, we get there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> pairs that work (we just need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c4e0c05562ebdf3d82001c6a9948542959999f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2z&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/005f825cf9a0370befeed55aba913bea528f98bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y,z) = (8,5), (8,6), (8,7), (7,4), (7,5), (7,6), (6,4), (6,5), (5,3), (5,4), (4,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"592\" height=\"20\" />. With <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we can re-arrange these in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/3920c5e3f6b2e5749cd75c3853b63ae714d00561.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3!=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> ways each, hence the answer is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/2/322e12f3231013340e372fa58dbe004dbda30f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120 + 6 \\cdot 11 = \\boxed{186}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"155\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~ScoutViolet\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Bounding.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Bounding)\">Solution 4 (Bounding)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Bounding)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb73c5a7af0328b43f623825f0e9473cd2ad2cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z&gt;2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> then this must hold, as if it didn't, we would need, WLOG, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/6/c26a06334e4c042349e76165438afba5da57fbef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;3y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" /> which would imply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/0/6e03d409d17beaf1e8a5a11c53e104256785b555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;8.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> Therefore, there are at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/0/5d0ae0b48ba89fd31c319c1f9baf9b505e94b5f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\times 5\\times 4=120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" /> solutions. However, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/03668d8b6f55e6a4b152c760dfb2e86016ab798b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z\\ge2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> as if any variable is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced6b9b2e75857b566f1e516560c4a4d63977299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> this clearly doesn't work, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b762aaad3d31ac8c8168d399342418e9c9282d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/b/dbbc066f7b15f286794f6569d4686cfac58509e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> which is impossible. Therefore, there are at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd7c3d16fd223a1bef3e8f1edce39b194c4838c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\times6\\times5=210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" /> solutions. The only choice that works from here is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f87faf7591262c305ec00a445c1f5f12d6b95bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}~186}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />\n~krithikrokcs\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5.28Compl._Counting.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5(Compl._Counting)\">Solution 5(Compl. Counting)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5(Compl. Counting)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total number of cases is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17de4fa37145bc2b2a87bcad377a5f508e828999.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7*6*5=210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"115\" height=\"14\" />. Note that no number can be 1, since that would result in cases like <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c320c71619dcd524877e17a292ef54037dc3c4e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9261c0ecda8a31e1dd8875103d3dd4ea0447ae88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> which is impossible.\n</p><p>We can try complementary counting. Since in this problem x,y,z cases are symmetrical, we first consider cases where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abc1bc157f98c6e7d125f0d93dfdf96187e723f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />. The cases are:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/1/9e1fb837e51cb69de2f372e9f9ba18b63d4f042c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z): (2,3,6) (2,3,7) (2,3,8) (2,4,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"307\" height=\"20\" />. By symmetry, the cases that don't work amounts to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27c4d3b11856039ed2bf50b8a5792af02509dcbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4*6=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" /> cases. Therefore the total number of cases that work is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23fb5bf50e3cc16529fe2f7256371368c336e879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$210-24=186$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f87faf7591262c305ec00a445c1f5f12d6b95bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}~186}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />.\n~backtosq-1\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Symmetry_.2B_Complementary_Counting.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Symmetry_+_Complementary_Counting)\">Solution 6 (Symmetry + Complementary Counting)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Symmetry + Complementary Counting)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/5411e7e210fe4277fcbe03f517ff043ba73b6eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ x,y,z \\} \\subset \\{ 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"237\" height=\"20\" />, WLOG let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea6b86e61f410d78d18de30a334d48b54627fe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le x&lt;y&lt;z\\le 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"17\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/6/69649d902ef1defed514295a196209257bc04e7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\times 3! =6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" />). Note that the lower bounds make the conditions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/b/03b57f62ee6f4ba359974d96f9c7e7d7df560956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;xz\\le 1z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/4/6b43fe34c69771a91975272194a2eaf9ba34da57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;zy&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /> trivial. In addition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> always fails, since it would force <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/6/0763eb38ad1e510ad51a071aa0fbcd53954842de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&lt;xy=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />, a contradiction. Thus, it remains exactly to check <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a94ed41106ff2e5de4dc504bd0bfddd7ee91b8af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\le x&lt;y&lt;z\\le 8&lt;xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>The only failure cases with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/c/d3c672744acd1d4b22949bf978643cedd4b4b41a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy\\le 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> can occur when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d17df801f4e337e00b74028bd7d32b3eaa654ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)=(2,3),(2,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" />, for which we have corresponding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/2/7528f026f4368416644f57400d912a26db7fda9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\in \\{ 6,7,8 \\},\\{ 8 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" />. The total number of cases is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f40675008fc11f525b8d61d31105ea8e5b8dda0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{7}{3}=35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"79\" height=\"53\" />. Thus, the number of good cases is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/9/0c942384c7a86fa74f78581a5d2be1685ad35ec7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35-4=31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, and after multiplying by order we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/540d457898a3a758e9f4ec5ec2a8c3ef545cb52f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3!\\cdot 31=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}~186}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"144\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~imosilver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_OmegaLearn.org\">Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn.org</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn.org\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OPQbAyYZBtA\">https://youtu.be/OPQbAyYZBtA</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dAeyV60Hu5c\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dAeyV60Hu5c</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math_.28Intuitive.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math_(Intuitive)\">Video Solution by Continuum Math (Intuitive)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Continuum Math (Intuitive)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GGrguJktt1k\">https://youtu.be/GGrguJktt1k</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MadMath_.28No_Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MadMath_(No_Brute_Force)\">Video Solution by MadMath (No Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MadMath (No Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Wss0PlENV0I\">https://youtu.be/Wss0PlENV0I</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n